#. Plugin Name of the plugin
msgid "LRob - Email Toolkit"
msgstr "LRob - Email Toolkit"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
msgid "https://www.lrob.fr/wordpress/plugins/lrob-email-toolkit/"
msgstr "https://www.lrob.fr/wordpress/plugins/lrob-email-toolkit/"

#. Description of the plugin
msgid ""
"All-in-one modular email plugin: SMTP routing, email logging, contact forms, "
"newsletters, captcha, and webhook integrations. Each module is independently "
"activatable."
msgstr ""
"Extension email tout-en-un modulaire : routage SMTP, journalisation des "
"emails, formulaires de contact, newsletters, captcha et intégrations "
"webhook. Chaque module est activable indépendamment."

#. Author of the plugin
